# Build context for platform-admin-web/Dockerfile.
#
# The Dockerfile copies the whole directory, because tsconfig.json's `include`
# lists src, tests, e2e, e2e-real, vite and the playwright configs -- an
# enumerated COPY list has to track that array forever, and the previous version
# already fell out of step with it and could not build.
#
# So the directory goes in and this file takes out what must not: install and
# build output that the image rebuilds itself, local test artefacts, and
# anything secret-shaped.

node_modules
dist
test-results
playwright-report
coverage

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.publishsettings
id_rsa*

.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
*.log
.DS_Store
README.md
